data: {"id": "89ef83e3f806403f-thinking-parallel_evidence-982", "run_id": "89ef83e3f806403f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 2. 证据分析与结论\n\n#### **已采集事实**\n1.  **Pod 状态与阶段**：Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 处于 `Pending` 阶段（对应上游报告的 `ContainerCreating` 状态），调度到节点 `node2` (10.2.0.50)。\n2.  **核心错误事件**：Kubernetes Events 显示连续的 `Warning NoNetworkFound` 事件，明确指出 Multus CNI 插件无法创建沙箱，原因是缺失 `network-attachment-definition` 资源 `unavailable-network`。\n3.  **Pod 规格**：Pod YAML 确认没有声明 Volume 挂载，而是引用了 CNI 网络注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks`，指向一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的定义。\n4.  **可观测性指标**：Metrics 证实 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789064518784, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

